  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into small chunks. Cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks. Cut zucchini into rounds.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray and drizzle of olive oil. Season. Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, zest lemon and slice into wedges. Pick oregano leaves.\n• In a small bowl, combine a squeeze of lemon juice, lemon zest and a drizzle of olive oil. Season and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60a3586b82079015b3217c03/step-419a9487.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, add the water and vegetable stock pot. Bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous. Stir to combine, cover with a lid and remove from the heat. Set aside until all the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60a3586b82079015b3217c03/step-759b5fb2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice haloumi into 1cm slices and pat dry. Season with garlic & herb seasoning.\n• Heat a large frying pan over a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook the haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from the heat and add the honey, oregano and sesame seeds. Turn to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60a3586b82079015b3217c03/step-4350dfae.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the roasted veggies, spinach & rocket mix and the lemon dressing to the couscous pan. Gently toss to coat and season to taste.\n• Divide the roasted veggie couscous between bowls. Top with the honey\u0002sesame haloumi and spoon over any remaining sauce. Serve with any remaining lemon wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60a3586b82079015b3217c03/step-b0dbac4a.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
